          %h2#properties Properties
          %h3#rigidity Rigidity
          %p
            %a{:href => "#Lurie"} HA 2.4.1.5
            constructs a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cartesian+symmetric+monoidal+%E2%88%9E-category"} Cartesian symmetric monoidal ∞-category
            structure
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msup
                    %mi 𝒞
                    %mo ×
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{C}^\times
            on
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi 𝒞
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{C}
            whenever
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi 𝒞
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{C}
            has all finite products, and by unwinding definitions,
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi 𝒞
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{C}
            has all finite products if it attains a Cartesian symmetric monoidal structure.
          %p
            Additionally,
            %a{:href => "#Lurie"} HA 2.4.1.7
            characterizes functors from Cartesian symmetric monoidal
            = succeed "-categories" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mn ∞
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \infty
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "#2.4.1.5"} HA 2.4.1.5
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msubsup
                    %mi{:mathvariant => "normal"} Cat
                    %mn ∞
                    %mo ×
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathrm{Cat}_\infty^\times
            denotes the subcategory of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi{:mathvariant => "normal"} Cat
