                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathrm{Alg}_{\mathcal{O}}(\mathcal{C}^{\times}) \rightarrow \mathrm{Fun}(\mathcal{O}^{\otimes}, \mathcal{C})
              is fully faithful with image spanned by the
              = succeed "-monoids." do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
